      "widgets_values": [
        "Scene controlled-view workflow (expanded).\\n\\n1. Load a TARGET-VIEW control image in the upper LoadImage node. This should be a canny / rough layout / target composition image representing the desired 45deg or side view.\\n2. Load the original scene master image in the lower LoadImage node. This is used to preserve scene identity.\\n3. Edit the prompt in CLIPTextEncode.\\n4. Run to generate one new controlled scene view.\\n\\nOutput resolution is fixed to 1024x576."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
